sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as HTTP Client
    participant E as Inbound HTTP Endpoint
    participant R as Router
    participant HA as Handler A
    participant HB as Handler B
    C ->> E: POST /events (target = Handler A)
    Note over E,R: Process Inbound Event
    E ->> R: handle(Event)
    R ->> HA: Delegate to Capability
    Note over HA,HB: Dispatch Between Local Capabilities
    alt async dispatch
        HA ->> R: dispatcher.send(event, target = Handler B)
        R ->> HB: Delegate to Capability
        HB -->> R: Event (response)
        R -->> HA: Event (future completes)
    else sync dispatch with timeout
        HA ->> R: dispatcher.send(event, target = Handler B, timeout)
        R ->> HB: Delegate to Capability
        HB -->> R: Event (response), or timeout elapses
        R -->> HA: Event, or EventHandlingException on timeout/interruption
    end
    HA -->> R: composed Event
    R -->> E: Event
    E -->> C: HTTP response
    Note over HA,HB: Code: io.eventbob.core.Dispatcher, EventBob
    Note over HA,HB: Tests: DispatcherTest, EventBobTest
